reconcile_statement matches a statement line to a ticket by its account reference and nothing else. A line whose reference matches no ticket is added to suspense with reason "unknown reference", counted in result.suspended, and reconciliation continues with the next line (it no longer raises NotFound).

Rejected: Matching on phone number and amount: phone and fare repeat when a conductor pays for a group, causing the Easter Monday mispayments. Taking the ticket closest in time: the same guess with a smaller window.
Because: Finance meeting, 3 June: until April a fallback matched an unknown reference to the open ticket with the same phone and amount from the last ten minutes. Conductors often pay from their own phone for a whole group, so one phone and fare repeat on a statement. On Easter Monday 31 tickets on route 46 were marked paid against the wrong passengers and those crews came up short at cash-up. Unmatched lines go to a person through suspense. Raising NotFound stopped the rest of the file being applied, forcing finance to split and re-upload statements.
